{"id":"question.physiology.renal.urine-concentration.001","kind":"original_concept_question","lessonId":"physiology.renal.urine-concentration","media":{"items":[{"columns":[{"id":"c0","label":"변수"},{"id":"c1","label":"값"},{"id":"c2","label":"단위"}],"id":"question.physiology.renal.urine-concentration.001.media.089-question-comparison","rows":[{"cells":["Uosm",600,"mOsm/kg"],"id":"r0"},{"cells":["Posm",300,"mOsm/kg"],"id":"r1"},{"cells":["V",1,"mL/min"],"id":"r2"}],"stage":"question","title":"주어진 삼투 자료","type":"table"}],"schemaVersion":"1.0.0"},"options":[{"id":"A","text":"+1mL/분"},{"id":"B","text":"+2mL/분"},{"id":"C","text":"−2mL/분"},{"id":"D","text":"0mL/분"},{"id":"E","text":"−1mL/분"}],"prompt":"같은 시간대에 채취한 소변과 혈장의 삼투질농도 및 소변 유량은 표와 같다. 삼투청소율을 Uosm×V/Posm, 자유수청소율을 V−Cosm으로 계산할 때 자유수청소율은?","verificationStatus":"editorial_draft_not_exam_validated"}